1
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:51,000
The Wild, Wild West just got wilder with Tom and Jerry on the ranch!

2
00:07:30,000 --> 00:07:36,000
Tom and Jerry Cowboy Up! is a animation, comedy, family
film directed by Darrell Van Citters.

3
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:21,000
This time, the rivals team up to help a cowgirl and her brother save their
homestead from a greedy land-grabber, and they’re going to need some help!

4
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:06,000
Jerry’s three precocious nephews are all ready for action, and
Tom is rounding up a posse of prairie dogs.

5
00:18:45,000 --> 00:18:51,000
But can a ragtag band of varmints defeat a deceitful desperado
determined to deceive a damsel in distress?

6
00:22:30,000 --> 00:22:36,000
No matter what happens with Tom and Jerry in the saddle,
it’ll be a rootin’ tootin’ good time!

