13
00:48:45,000 --> 00:48:51,000
Tom and Jerry: Cowboy Up!

14
00:52:30,000 --> 00:52:36,000
is a 2022 American animated direct-to-video Western comedy film
starring Tom and Jerry, produced by Warner Bros.

15
00:56:15,000 --> 00:56:21,000
It is the first Tom and Jerry direct-to-video animated film in five years since 2017's Tom and
Jerry: Willy Wonka and the Chocolate Factory, and a continuation of the film series.

16
01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
It is also the first Tom and Jerry direct-to-video animated film to feature the animation services of Renegade Animation, the studio
that animated The Tom and Jerry Show (2014–21) and Tom and Jerry in New York (2021), and Slap Happy Cartoons in Canada.

17
01:03:45,000 --> 01:03:51,000
It was released to DVD and digital in the United
States and Canada on January 25, 2022.

18
01:07:30,000 --> 01:07:36,000
An animated Christmas film called Tom and Jerry: Snowman's Land
was released later that year in November 2022.

19
01:11:15,000 --> 01:11:21,000
The tone is lighthearted.
